  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3\" class=\"elementor elementor-3\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d2a9e92 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6d2a9e92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee7e297 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"ee7e297\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7d8d95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c7d8d95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Privacy Policy\n</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d62112 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9d62112\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Who We Are</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-143d979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"143d979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">This Privacy Policy describes how LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> (&#8220;Company&#8221;, &#8220;we&#8221;, &#8220;us&#8221;, or &#8220;our&#8221;) collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you visit <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> (the &#8220;Website&#8221;) or use our coaching, speaking, and online course services (the &#8220;Services&#8221;).</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"293\">If you have any questions, you can contact us at:<br />• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a> (preferred)<br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"444\">Suppose you are in the European Economic Area (EEA), the United Kingdom (UK), or another region with data protection laws. In that case, we act as a &#8220;data controller&#8221; for the personal data we collect about you.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9035024 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9035024\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Information We Collect</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f38f594 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f38f594\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"639\"><strong>We may collect the following categories of information:</strong></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"721\">a) Information you provide directly<br />• Name and contact details (such as email address and phone number)<br />• Billing details and transaction-related information (processed via third-party providers)<br />• Information provided when purchasing, registering for, or using our Services<br />• Messages sent through contact forms, email, or other communication channels<br />• Testimonials, feedback, or survey responses you choose to provide</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1143\">b) Information collected automatically<br />When you use the Website, we may automatically collect:<br />• IP address<br />• Browser type and version<br />• Device type and operating system<br />• Pages visited, time spent on pages, and referring URLs<br />• Approximate location based on IP address<br />• Cookie identifiers and similar tracking technologies</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1469\">c) Information from third parties<br />We may receive information from:<br />• Payment processors<br />• Email marketing platforms<br />• Analytics and advertising providers<br />• Social media platforms if you interact with our content there</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd64f08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cd64f08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How We Use Your Information</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6734d51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6734d51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We may use your personal information to:<br />• Provide, operate, and maintain the Website and Services<br />• Process and complete orders, bookings, and payments<br />• Respond to your inquiries, messages, and support requests<br />• Send transactional communications (e.g., confirmations, receipts, service updates)<br />• Send marketing communications where permitted by law and your preferences<br />• Personalize and improve user experience and our offerings<br />• Analyze Website performance and usage to improve our content and Services<br />• Detect, prevent, and address technical or security issues<br />• Comply with legal obligations under U.S. and applicable international law</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5fca75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d5fca75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Legal Bases for Processing (EEA/UK Visitors)</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5990cc2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5990cc2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Where data protection laws apply (e.g., GDPR), we rely on one or more of the following legal bases:<br />• Performance of a contract<br />• Legitimate interests (such as running, improving, and securing our business and Services)<br />• Consent (e.g., for certain marketing communications and cookie-based tracking)<br />• Compliance with legal obligations</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-408b022 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"408b022\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Marketing Communications</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f88bc1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3f88bc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you opt in to receive our newsletter, updates, or other promotional communications, we may send you emails about our content, offers, and Services. You can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the &#8220;unsubscribe&#8221; link in our emails or by contacting us at <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a>.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c74c800 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c74c800\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9fde49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f9fde49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We use cookies and similar technologies to operate our Website, remember your preferences, and analyze Website usage. Some cookies may be necessary for the functioning of the Website, while others are used for analytics or marketing. For more details, please see our Cookie Policy.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0bb22bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0bb22bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How We Share Your Information</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ceb9445 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ceb9445\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"ak-ol\" start=\"1\" data-indent-level=\"1\"><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">We do not sell your personal information. We may share personal information with:<br />• Service providers and vendors who perform services on our behalf (e.g., hosting, email, analytics, payment processing)<br />• Professional advisors such as lawyers and accountants under confidentiality obligations<br />• Government authorities or law enforcement where required by applicable law or to protect our rights, property, or safety<br />• Successors or acquirers in connection with a merger, sale, or other business reorganization</p></li></ol><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3928\">These third parties are expected to process personal data only as necessary and to protect it with appropriate safeguards.</p><ol class=\"ak-ol\" start=\"1\" data-indent-level=\"1\"><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4054\">International Data Transfers<br />We are based in the United States and may use service providers operating in other countries. If you are located in the EEA, UK, or another jurisdiction with data transfer restrictions, your data may be transferred outside your region. Where required by law, we implement appropriate safeguards (such as Standard Contractual Clauses) for international transfers.</p></li><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4449\">Data Retention<br />We retain personal data only for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this Policy, including to:<br />• Provide the Services<br />• Comply with legal, tax, and accounting requirements<br />• Resolve disputes and enforce agreements</p></li></ol><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4715\">When personal data is no longer needed, we will delete it or anonymize it.</p><ol class=\"ak-ol\" start=\"1\" data-indent-level=\"1\"><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4793\">Your Rights<br />Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including to:<br />• Request access to personal data we hold about you<br />• Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data<br />• Request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal obligations<br />• Object to or request restriction of certain processing activities<br />• Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent<br />• Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority</p></li></ol><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5273\">To make a request, contact us at <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a>. We may request additional information to verify your identity.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8331e8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8331e8b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Children's Privacy</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3846aec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3846aec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">Our Website and Services are not directed to children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16. If you believe that a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so that we can delete it.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a1a18c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2a1a18c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Security</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a53db70 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a53db70\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal data from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or alteration. However, no method of transmission or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-932950e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"932950e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Third-Party Websites</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6bc14a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d6bc14a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">The Website may contain links to third-party websites or services that we do not control. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-478212b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"478212b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-281e9bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"281e9bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The &#8220;Last updated&#8221; date at the top indicates the latest revision. Your continued use of the Website after any changes are posted signifies your acceptance of the updated Policy.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e1917c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3e1917c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact Us</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-161d83e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"161d83e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3385\">If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact:<br />• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa1a03e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"aa1a03e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
